    <bpmn:process id="W_W4297" name="W4297. Daily Delivery Manifest, Load Planning &amp; Dispatch" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Day&#x27;s bulky deliveries confirmed (W4291)
Frequency: Daily per DC/store catchment
Volume: Per-day manifests × ~each serving DC/store; each manifest = multi-stop two-man route
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Dispatch / DC Ops (VS-04) / Logistics (VS-06.3)
Participants: DC Ops (VS-04), Store Ops (VS-07), Crews/Drivers, 3PL (VS-56), Customer Service (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4297 — Daily Delivery Manifest, Load Planning &amp; Dispatch</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4297_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4297_Lane1" name="Dispatch">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4297_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4297_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4297_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4297_Lane2" name="DC Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4297_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4297_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4297_Start4" name="Day&#x27;s bulky deliveries confirmed (W4291)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4297_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4297_Task5" name="Dispatch/DC build the day&#x27;s manifest from confirmed orders — sequence by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Dispatch/DC build the day&#x27;s manifest from confirmed orders — sequence by time-window + zone, group by vehicle type (W4294), and assign two-man crews by install-license match (W4293)
Responsible (R): Dispatch / DC Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Bulky Delivery
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4297_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4297_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4297_Task6" name="DC Ops pick/stage bulky items, verify against manifest (item, install-kit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC Ops pick/stage bulky items, verify against manifest (item, install-kit, haul-away flag), load in reverse-stop order with securing equipment, and release to crew with e-manifest + customer instructions
Responsible (R): DC Ops / Crew
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4297_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4297_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4297_Task7" name="Dispatch push e-manifest to crew device, send customer ETA notifications…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Dispatch push e-manifest to crew device, send customer ETA notifications (VS-75/VS-13), and track in real-time against the route
Responsible (R): Dispatch / Customer Service
Accountable (A): Head of Bulky Delivery
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4297_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4297_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4297_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4297_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4297_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-660 (ensure controlled execution — Delivery Execution, Installation &amp; In-Home Service Operations (PA-143.2).) | - CTL-660: manifest-vs-load verification at staging; crew-license match before dispatch (W4293)
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Dispatch / DC Ops (VS-04) / Logistics (VS-06.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4297_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4297_Annotation9" targetRef="W4297_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
