    <bpmn:process id="W_W4298" name="W4298. In-Home Delivery Execution, Site Protection &amp; Handoff" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Crew arrives at customer address
Frequency: Per bulky stop
Volume: Bulky-delivery stop volume (manifests × stops)
Owner: Two-Man Crew / Bulky-Delivery Operations
Participants: Driver/Installer, Customer, Customer Service (VS-13), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4298 — In-Home Delivery Execution, Site Protection &amp; Handoff</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4298_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4298_Lane1" name="Crew">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4298_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4298_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4298_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4298_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4298_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4298_Start3" name="Crew arrives at customer address">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4298_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4298_Task4" name="Crew verify customer/identity and site access, lay floor/wall protection, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Crew verify customer/identity and site access, lay floor/wall protection, and plan the carry path (stairs/elevator/clearances) per the pre-delivery check (W4292)
Responsible (R): Crew
Accountable (A): Crew Lead
Duration: Per stop</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4298_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4298_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4298_Task5" name="Crew team-lift/roll the item to the install location using equipment (W4294)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Crew team-lift/roll the item to the install location using equipment (W4294), set in place, remove packaging, and collect for haul-away/recycling where applicable (W4305)
Responsible (R): Crew
Accountable (A): Crew Lead
Duration: Per stop</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4298_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4298_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4298_Task6" name="Crew hand off to installer if separate (W4299) or complete placement, brief the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Crew hand off to installer if separate (W4299) or complete placement, brief the customer on use/care, and capture handoff confirmation
Responsible (R): Crew / Installer
Accountable (A): Crew Lead
Duration: Per stop</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4298_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4298_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4298_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4298_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4298_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-660 (ensure controlled execution — Delivery Execution, Installation &amp; In-Home Service Operations (PA-143.2).) | - CTL-660: site protection used; team-lift SOP; handoff captured (e-POD) before crew departure
Owner: Two-Man Crew / Bulky-Delivery Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4298_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4298_Annotation8" targetRef="W4298_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
