        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-660 (ensure controlled execution — Delivery Execution, Installation &amp; In-Home Service Operations (PA-143.2).) | - CTL-660: 3PL specialist terms + insurance/bonding (VS-26); SLA-governed; HSE-compliant (W4304)
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Partner Mgmt / 3PL (VS-56) / Procurement (VS-34)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
