    <bpmn:process id="W_W4304" name="W4304. Field Service Safety, DOLE OSH, Heavy-Lifting &amp; Customer-Premises Liability" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program operation; incident; HSE review
Frequency: Continuous + per incident
Volume: All bulky-delivery field operations + incidents
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Bulky-Delivery Operations / Risk (VS-21.2)
Participants: HSE (VS-24), HR (VS-19/VS-98), Insurance (VS-26), Legal (VS-100.3), Risk (VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W4304 — Field Service Safety, DOLE OSH, Heavy-Lifting &amp; Customer-Premises Liability</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4304_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4304_Lane1" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4304_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4304_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4304_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4304_Lane2" name="Crew">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4304_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4304_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4304_Start4" name="Program operation; incident; HSE review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4304_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4304_Task5" name="HSE/Delivery Ops set the field-service safety standard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HSE/Delivery Ops set the field-service safety standard (manual-handling/team-lift, lift-gate use, appliance securing, electrical/gas/refrigerant install safety, customer-premises conduct) per DOLE OSH
Responsible (R): HSE / Delivery Ops
Accountable (A): HSE Mgr / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4304_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4304_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4304_Task6" name="Crews/Installers execute pre-task hazard check, use required PPE/equipment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Crews/Installers execute pre-task hazard check, use required PPE/equipment (W4294), and report incidents/near-miss immediately
Responsible (R): Crew / Installer
Accountable (A): Crew Lead
Duration: Per task</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4304_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4304_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4304_Task7" name="HSE/Legal/Insurance manage incidents (injury, property damage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HSE/Legal/Insurance manage incidents (injury, property damage, customer-premises liability), investigate, file insurance (VS-26), and feed the risk register (VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): HSE / Legal / Insurance / Risk
Accountable (A): HSE Mgr / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4304_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4304_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4304_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4304_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4304_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-660 (ensure controlled execution — Delivery Execution, Installation &amp; In-Home Service Operations (PA-143.2).) | - CTL-660: field-service SOP per DOLE OSH; PPE/lift-gate used; incidents reported &amp; insured (VS-26); risks in ERM (VS-21.2)
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Bulky-Delivery Operations / Risk (VS-21.2)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
